Add X close button on video picker screen

• Added a top header bar with an X (close) button and "Select Video"
  title on the gallery/file picker screen (Upload tab).
• Header has a semi-transparent dark background that matches the
  black gallery theme.
• X button closes the Post activity and returns to the previous
  screen — no animation, feels snappy.
• Fixed RecyclerView height constraint so it sits below the header.
